lumn", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "86edb42", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci nezávaznou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "23ae6df", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Zavolat 731 842 606", "link": {"url": "tel:+420731842606", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--ghost ww-btn--plain"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "f965731", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span>✓ Weby od 9 900 Kč</span><span>✓ Nabídka zdarma</span><span>✓ Koncept agentury Yesmark</span></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-trust ww-rv"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "fa22d35", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<figure class=\"v-hv\"><img src=\"https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg\" alt=\"Tvorba webových stránek – ukázka webu KONRADT\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Reference · KONRADT</figcaption></figure>", "_css_classes": "ww-rv"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "c1d1a3a", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white ww-tocsec", "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "0510af1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e19b6ef", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><b>Na této stránce:</b><a href=\"#o-sluzbe\">Tvorba webu, která začíná u vašeho byznysu</a><a href=\"#prehled\">Postup</a><a href=\"#detail\">Podrobnosti</a><a href=\"#reference\">Reference</a><a href=\"#cenik\">Cena a FAQ</a><a href=\"#poptavka\">Poptávka</a></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-toc"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "437f147", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-white", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "o-sluzbe"}, "elements": [{"id": "1a03755", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-local", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a00e696", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-local-copy ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "aebf9ba", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Hlavní služba", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ac371db", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Tvorba webu, která začíná u vašeho byznysu", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ad12f7f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dobrý web nezačíná výběrem barev, ale otázkou: co má návštěvník udělat? Zavolat, poslat poptávku, rezervovat termín, nebo nakoupit? Tvorba webových stránek u nás proto začíná krátkým rozhovorem o vašich zákaznících, službách a konkurenci. Teprve potom navrhujeme strukturu, texty a design.</p><p>Za wwwwww.cz stojí webové studio z Jeseníku a tým marketingové agentury Yesmark. Weby tvoříme pro řemeslníky, služby, ubytování, výrobní firmy i obce a spolky z celé České republiky. Spolupráce běží osobně nebo online – jak vám to vyhovuje.</p><p>Profesionální tvorba webových stránek pro nás znamená kompletní servis: návrh, texty, fotky, technické nastavení, základní SEO, napojení na Google Analytics a předání webu tak, abyste si ho uměli sami upravovat.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "0bcd2ca", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-citycard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "dbb9803", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Co dostanete", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "79b572f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul class=\"ww-checklist\"><li>Návrh struktury a designu na míru</li><li>Web pro mobil, tablet i počítač</li><li>Pomoc s texty a fotkami</li><li>Základní SEO a Google Firemní profil</li><li>Formuláře, mapy a napojení na e-mail</li><li>Cookies lištu a GDPR</li><li>Zaškolení do administrace</li><li>Podporu i po spuštění</li></ul>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bd0dd42", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Probrat můj web", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "769b7ce", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "prehled"}, "elements": [{"id": "99ddcf6", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "24329d4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d7fa94a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e08fdf3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Postup", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6c0d794", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Jak probíhá tvorba webových stránek", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "764fdfb", "elType": "widget", "w